### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Create a product
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "sku": "KB-001",
  "quantity": 12,
  "price": 79.99,
  "description": "Compact keyboard"
}

### List products
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/products?limit=20&offset=0

### Search products
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/products?search=Keyboard

### Get product
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/products/1

### Update product
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 7
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/products/1
